  "description": "Introducing Monosock, a layered, graffiti-inspired font that is bursting with character and creativity. Boasting three unique styles – solid, inner shadow, and shadow, Monosock is your go-to font for bringing a 3D pop of life to any design. This font is an embodiment of street ambiance and urban dynamism, making it an ideal choice for projects that require a daring and bold look, such as posters, clothing, branding, and much more. Monosock’s layered attributes grant you the creative liberty to experiment, mix, and match styles until you have the most suited aesthetic for your unique piece of art. Experience the edgy magic Monosock brings to your work today.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Introducing Monosock, a layered, graffiti-inspired font that is bursting with character and creativity. Boasting three unique styles – solid, inner shadow, and shadow, Monosock is your go-to font for bringing a 3D pop of life to any design. This font is an embodiment of street ambiance and urban dynamism, making it an ideal choice for projects that require a daring and bold look, such as posters, clothing, branding, and much more. Monosock’s layered attributes grant you the creative liberty to experiment, mix, and match styles until you have the most suited aesthetic for your unique piece of art. Experience the edgy magic Monosock brings to your work today.</p>",
